Subject: [PATCH] Add bounded checkpoint-bound steering profiles

Base: c001cc4ed77bef686ddd006be0dd706b9c15d7b7 (r6v author series). Rationale: small content-addressed safetensors profiles without weight mutation or serving-time pickle. Quality: validates provenance and unit directions; output changes only after later projection integration. Validation: CPU artifact and replica identity contract tests. Upstream status: independent downstream experiment; no upstream submission.
